 pt-40 pb-60 lg:px-70 lg:py-80"><div class=3D"flex flex-col gap-40"><h2 cla=
ss=3D"text-black type-h5">We're building a new category of AI hardware: <sp=
an class=3D"text-black">frontier inference clusters.</span></h2><div><p cla=
ss=3D"type-paragraph-regular mb-[1.6em] last:mb-0 text-paragraph">We co-des=
ign chips, racks, software, and manufacturing methods so frontier models ca=
n run with best-in-class throughput, latency, cost, and power efficiency fo=
r both prefill and decode workloads.</p><p class=3D"type-paragraph-regular =
mb-[1.6em] last:mb-0 text-paragraph">Earlier this year our <strong class=3D=
"type-paragraph-bold text-black">A0 silicon </strong>came back from TSMC N4=
P, and today we are busy validating our first rack-scale product with custo=
mers to fulfill $1B in demand.</p><p class=3D"type-paragraph-regular mb-[1.=
6em] last:mb-0 text-paragraph">We're a team of 400+ engineers from NVIDIA, =
Google TPUs, Broadcom, SK Hynix, TSMC, and more. We've raised $800M across =
four unannounced financings, including a strategic investment from VentureT=
ech Alliance. We're excited to deepen our partnership with the world's lead=
ing semiconductor manufacturer.</p></div><h2 class=3D"text-black type-h5">D=
esigning a New Pareto Frontier</h2><div><p class=3D"type-paragraph-regular =
mb-[1.6em] last:mb-0 text-paragraph">Our inference systems are built to pus=
h the entire pareto curve on frontier models, including many-trillion-param=
eter MoEs, long context, and agentic workloads. This required intense co-de=
sign, from new chips, packages, PCBs, cold plates, interconnects, and more.=
 Today, we're sharing two breakthroughs to make this happen:</p><h3 class=
=3D"type-h6 text-black">Low Voltage Inference (LVI) for high throughput wor=
kloads</h3><p class=3D"type-paragraph-regular mb-[1.6em] last:mb-0 text-par=
agraph"></p><p class=3D"type-paragraph-regular mb-[1.6em] last:mb-0 text-pa=
ragraph">Today, AI chips can't scale FLOPs without thermal throttling. As F=
LOPs utilization increases, AI chips draw more power and downregulate clock=
 speed. This often results in sustained inference throughput under half of =
Peak FLOPs.</p><p class=3D"type-paragraph-regular mb-[1.6em] last:mb-0 text=
-paragraph">We've designed a new architecture to run our chip's math blocks=
 at under half the voltage of most AI chips. This enables multiple times th=
e FLOPs density of AI chips today. We can run trillion-parameter sparse MoE=
s at 80%+ Peak FLOPs without thermal throttling.</p><p class=3D"type-paragr=
aph-regular mb-[1.6em] last:mb-0 text-paragraph">Running LVI requires co-de=
signing the entire cluster from the transistor to the token: new splittable=
 math arrays, circuit techniques, novel tiling and scheduling algorithms, p=
ower delivery networks, VRM architectures, advanced packaging, cold plate d=
esigns, and more.</p><h3 class=3D"type-h6 text-black">Cluster Scale Memory =
(CSM) for low-latency workloads</h3><p class=3D"type-paragraph-regular mb-[=
1.6em] last:mb-0 text-paragraph"></p><p class=3D"type-paragraph-regular mb-=
[1.6em] last:mb-0 text-paragraph">Today's AI chips using HBM can't achieve =
SRAM-level decode speeds due to memory subsystem and interconnect bottlenec=
ks. SRAM-only chips have lower FLOPs density and memory capacity, sacrifici=
ng throughput.</p><p class=3D"type-paragraph-regular mb-[1.6em] last:mb-0 t=
ext-paragraph">We created a much lower-latency shared memory pool across ou=
r scale-up domain. We use a proprietary ultra-low-latency, high-bandwidth i=
nterconnect to enable dramatically faster memory access across chips.</p><p=
 class=3D"type-paragraph-regular mb-[1.6em] last:mb-0 text-paragraph">Our H=
BM/SRAM hybrid design solves both memory capacity and mem2mem latency, enab=
ling high throughput and interactivity simultaneously. CSM improves latency=
 and avoids today's cost, reliability, yield, thermal, and compute tradeoff=
s of SRAM-only chips, 3D DRAM chips, or optics.</p><p class=3D"type-paragra=
ph-regular mb-[1.6em] last:mb-0 text-paragraph">We've made co-design decisi=
ons hand-in-hand with leading AI companies, cloud providers, and hyperscale=
rs. We've tested racks in representative data center deployments, run terab=
ytes of production traffic patterns through our simulator, and had dozens o=
f engineers live overseas for months to co-design deeply with our supply-ch=
ain partners. If this sounds exciting, you should <a class=3D"underline dec=
oration-solid decoration-auto underline-offset-auto [text-underline-positio=
n:from-font] [text-decoration-skip-ink:auto]" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noop=
ener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.etched.com/join">join us</a>.</p></div=
><h2 class=3D"text-black type-h5">Getting to Gigawatt Scale</h2><div><p cla=
ss=3D"type-paragraph-regular mb-[1.6em] last:mb-0 text-paragraph">Early cus=
tomer tests show us achieving SOTA throughput, latency, and power efficienc=
y on inference workloads. We'll be sharing more updates on our performance =
and roadmap this summer.</p><p class=3D"type-paragraph-regular mb-[1.6em] l=
ast:mb-0 text-paragraph">Our first racks ship this summer, and we've kicked=
 off production to fulfill over $1B in customer contracts. To enable 24/7 e=
ngineering cycles, we've opened a Taiwan factory and built a data center, t=
est house, and NPI prototyping lab in our San Jose office.</p><p class=3D"t=
ype-paragraph-regular mb-[1.6em] last:mb-0 text-paragraph">We are verticall=
y integrated to get to Gigawatt scale as quickly as possible. Math block de=
signers sit next to inference engineers, thermal experts next to GSMs.</p><=
